## Decisions and Action Items

1. **IETF Trust Dissolution:** The Trustees of the IETF Trust unanimously voted to dissolve the Trust following the complete transfer of all assets, liabilities, domain names, and IANA IPR to the IETF Intellectual Property Management Corporation (IPMC).
2. **NomCom Feedback Deadline:** NomCom feedback for 2026 leadership positions closes Thursday at 12:00 PM local time before deliberations begin.
3. **Rescheduled January AI Session:** The General Area session on AI measurement, use, and interventions was rescheduled for Friday, Session 4 (4:00 PM – 5:30 PM).

